              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Syntax and Close Order",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Auto-closes any ==AutoCloseable== declared in `try (...)`",
                "Closes in ==reverse order== of declaration",
                "Closing happens before any `catch` or `finally`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "try (BufferedReader br =",
                "     new BufferedReader(new FileReader(f))) {",
                "    return br.readLine();",
                "} catch (IOException e) {",
                "    handle(e);",
                "}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Body",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "close()",
                    "sub": "reverse order",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "catch",
                    "ink": "orange"
